<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ M-3 money supply rose 1.7 pct in March.</title>
<headline>NZ M-3 money supply rose 1.7 pct in March.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of New Zealand on Wednesday released the following estimated money supply figures for March.</p>
<p>    M3		     Mar 1997     Feb 1997	 Mar 1996</p>
<p>    mthly change	 +1.7 pct	+0.7 pct	+3.2 pct</p>
<p>    yr-on-yr change   +10.3 pct     +11.9 pct     +12.5 pct</p>
<p>    PSC		    Mar 1997     Feb 1997	 Mar 1996</p>
<p>    mthly change	 +0.7 pct     +0.5 pct	 +2.0 pct</p>
<p>    yr-on-yr change   +11.3 pct    +12.7 pct	+15.2 pct</p>
<p>    M1		     Mar 1997     Feb 1997	 Mar 1996</p>
<p>    mthly change	+10.6 pct    -0.5 pct	 +8.6 pct</p>
<p>    yr-on-yr change    +8.1 pct    +6.2 pct	 +7.5 pct</p>
<p>-- Welington Newsroom 64 4 4714 273</p>
</text>
